sequenceDiagram
    participant Sched as Scheduler
    participant Crawl as Crawler
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant DB as Data Store
    participant Score as Scoring Engine
    participant Sum as Summarizer
    participant LLM as Local LLM Runtime
    participant Trend as Trend Aggregator
    participant Dig as Digest Service
    participant SMTP as Email Provider
    participant API as Web API
    participant UI as Dashboard
    participant User as User

    Sched->>Crawl: trigger discovery run
    Crawl->>GH: query new/updated repos (GraphQL)
    GH-->>Crawl: repo metadata
    Crawl->>DB: upsert raw repo metadata

    Sched->>Score: trigger scoring pass
    Score->>DB: read unscored/updated repos
    Score->>DB: write computed scores (license, commits/wk, contributors, forks, stars)

    Sched->>Sum: trigger summarization pass
    Sum->>DB: read top-scored repos without summary
    Sum->>LLM: generate structured summary (README/manifest)
    LLM-->>Sum: summary text
    Sum->>DB: write summary

    Sched->>Trend: trigger trend rollup
    Trend->>DB: read scored + summarized repos
    Trend->>DB: write trend aggregates

    Sched->>Dig: trigger daily digest
    Dig->>DB: read top hidden gems + trends
    Dig->>SMTP: send digest email
    SMTP-->>User: deliver email

    User->>UI: browse Hidden Gems
    UI->>API: query repos, scores, summaries, trends
    API->>DB: read
    DB-->>API: results
    API-->>UI: JSON response

    User->>UI: bookmark repo
    UI->>API: POST bookmark
    API->>DB: write bookmark
